{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A triangle with integral sides has perimeter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The area of the triangle is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/941061609b7841a5ca6548907a91545a41dd5753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2\\sqrt{2}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{16}{9}\\sqrt{3}\\quad \\text{(C) }2\\sqrt{3} \\quad \\text{(D) } 4\\quad \\text{(E) } 4\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"375\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The shortest side must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However none of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30a4f98818b227e14358d51748399ae774b8dc1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,6),(1,2,5),(1,3,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"18\" /> form triangles, so the shortest side must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/2228a0c9e2c1f782b39c2d4712f85b8d788da03d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,2,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> is degenerate, so the sides must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72fe948983bda6c2ec8222b54114782b946fb423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>This can be cut in half and reassembled into a rectangle with one side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. By Pythagoras its area is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d4091ce096ade72ac87c96d6653144cb69b829e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\